Z||000010||Monkeyman||12-02-1999||05:41 PM||||I think TSN is a Canadian channel.  Look under their links, then Manufacturers.  They talk alot about Canadian mfrs.  (Ex. Ford Canada).  I'm with everybody else.  Send me a copy.  What do you think about $5US plus postage?  Just a suggestion although I don't know how much a blank tape costs up there.  You can get them for about a dollar a piece here if you buy a package of 10 or so.  And you aren't selling the tapes.  That would infringe on copyright laws.  Nobody's giving you any $$ for them.  It's just a donation?  Also, you might suggest that we purchase them for "educational" purposes.  That works for CD-ROMs.  Probably not a big deal anyway, but you might as well have an excuse in case anybody asks.  You might not want to advertise though.  Not even here.  That WOULD be an infringement.  (Just some words of advise.  I went through this a couple of years ago with the above mentioned CD-ROMs!)||||reg||1
